    <p>I'm a Performance Marketing Specialist focused on driving measurable growth and maximizing ROI through data-driven strategy and precise tracking infrastructure. From running paid campaigns across multiple platforms to building end-to-end tracking systems, I manage the entire funnel — from ad spend to accurate conversion data.</p>
    
