      <li>Google Ads – Driving high-intent traffic through Search, Display, Shopping, and Performance Max campaigns</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Tracking & Analytics Expertise:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Facebook Pixel – Accurate event tracking setup to ensure reliable conversion data</li>
      <li>Google Tag Manager (GTM) – Managing complex tags, triggers, and variables without touching backend code</li>
      <li>GA4 (Google Analytics 4) – User behavior analysis, custom event tracking, and reporting dashboards</li>
      <li>Server-Side Tracking – Implementing Conversion API and Server-Side GTM to reduce data loss and improve attribution accuracy in the post-iOS 14 and cookie-restricted era</li>
    </ul>

    <p>My goal isn't just to run campaigns — it's to build a complete tracking and analytics ecosystem that accurately measures every ad dollar's performance and enables truly data-driven decision-making.</p>
